{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"Roy sits down and drags his arm across the table to sweep all the tools back into the backpack, and slumps back in the chair. \"So do I. I think I want to take a walk later, once folks start waking up here so they can put all this with the rest of the stuff. I hope that plus whatever they got will make them *over*prepared.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T11:29:44.364000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869542068178018344","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
