{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"It's mostly the 'what am I even doing here right now' factor of trying to do that. I guess good thing I've learned a few things about homebrew back in the day. No idea if it really helped much, but it makes me a bit more confident.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T11:32:49.093000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869542842987597845","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
